{"id": 5729734, "status": 3, "overall": 2, "occupation_name": "인사/총무", "employ_status_name": false, "date": "2026. 04", "updated_at": "2026. 05", "do_not_report": false, "city_name": {"id": 1, "name": "서울", "country_id": 2, "weight": 1, "active": true, "created_at": "2014-02-13T19:33:47.000+09:00", "updated_at": "2015-10-26T17:54:22.000+09:00", "is_other": false, "needs_review": false, "parent_id": null}, "title": "언젠간 망할 줄 알았고 망해가더니 망했다더라 ", "auth": "opened", "pros": "1. 야근이 별로 없었음\n2. 워라벨이 충족되었음\n3. 사고 안치면 정년 보장", "cons": "1. 맨날 급여 동결당함\n2. 낮은 급여로 사람들 다 나감\n3. 고인물 천국임", "message_to_management": "망할 줄 알았는데, 망했네요. 안타까워요", "comments": 0, "comment_array": [], "current_page": "/api/v4/companies/reviews/93650/reviews.json?page=1", "is_survey": false, "last_year_at_employer": 2021, "is_recommend_badge_visible": false, "score": {"overall": 2, "advancement_rating": 3, "compensation_rating": 2, "worklife_balance_rating": 5, "culture_rating": 2, "management_rating": 2}, "is_helpful": false, "helpful_count": 0, "next_year_rating": 3, "recommend_to_friend": false, "company_picked": false}
